==== WorldObjectSprite ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The parameter specifies the tile that will be used when placing the item as an on square object (Tile).
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
WorldObjectSprite = furniture_storage_02_8,
</syntaxhighlight>
